      <h3>Client (Comprehensive)</h3>
      <p>Less than a dollar a day for connection, events, and practical support to age in place.</p>
      <ul class="list">
        <li>Social support calls and friendly visits</li>
        <li>Holiday deliveries and social activities</li>
        <li>Community events and light chores</li>
        <li>Technology help, service referrals, weekly errand</li>
        <li>Local senior center membership</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>$290 / year</strong> or <strong>$29 / month</strong></p>
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href="{{ base }}membership-information-request/">Become a client</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Friend (Social)</h3>
      <p>Stay connected with WPV events and member-led interest groups.</p>
      <p><strong>$100 / year</strong> or <strong>$9 / month</strong> (tax-deductible donation).</p>
      <p>Includes access to socials, educational events, lunches, movie outings, Scrabble club, cultural day trips, and more.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ base }}friend-application-form/">Become a Friend</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>Volunteer Membership</h3>
      <p>Strengthen community ties and support older neighbors with rides, errands, friendly visits, and events.</p>
      <p>Recommended to offset screening costs: <strong>$30</strong> one-time background check + <strong>$10</strong> annual update.</p>
      <div class="actions">
